/ One group of the Verwandte Drucksachen card: a heading and its Drucksachen
/ as compact rows, the first few shown and the rest behind a toggle (lists of
/ resolutions name two dozen). id makes the toggle's target unique on the page.
- shown = 5
.small.fw-semibold.text-secondary.pt-2= title
.list-group.list-group-flush
  - documents.first(shown).each do |document|
    = render 'documents/item', document:, compact: true
- if documents.size > shown
  .collapse id="related-#{id}"
    .list-group.list-group-flush
      - documents.drop(shown).each do |document|
        = render 'documents/item', document:, compact: true
  button.btn.btn-link.btn-sm.px-0.pb-2 type='button' data-bs-toggle='collapse' data-bs-target="#related-#{id}" aria-expanded='false' aria-controls="related-#{id}"
    = "#{documents.size - shown} weitere"
